}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlfowle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jlfowle","id":65310191,"login":"jlfowle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MzEwMTkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlfowle/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlfowle/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlfowle/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlfowle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlfowle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlfowle","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jlfowle/asterism/commits/1b12f46c67ec57af5976badbd4f13299e9b8270c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T01:09:33Z","email":"jasph.fowler@gmail.com","name":"Jasph Fowler"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T01:09:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: distribute deploy manifests to services with auto-discovery (#70)\n\n* docs: add deployment manifest standards\n\nEstablishes standard layout and discovery contract for service deploy manifests:\n- Per-service structure: services/{service}/deploy/kustomization.yaml + deploy/base/\n- Consolidated deploy auto-generated by scripts/update-deploy.sh\n- Service discovery based on Dockerfile, Makefile, and deploy/kustomization.yaml\n- Removes versioning-like ''latest'' folder in favor of direct kustomization.yaml\n\n* refactor: migrate service deploy manifests to services directories\n\nMove Kubernetes manifests from centralized deploy/{service}/ to distributed\nservices/{service}/deploy/:\n\n- services/{service}/deploy/base/: Contains 4 required manifest files\n  - deployment.yaml, service.yaml, route.yaml, externalsecret.yaml\n- services/{service}/deploy/kustomization.yaml: Entrypoint that references base/\n\nNew structure removes ''latest'' overlay layer and standardizes on direct\nkustomization.yaml as the contract entrypoint for consolidated deploy.\n\nAll services build successfully with: kustomize build services/{service}/deploy\n\n* feat: add auto-discovery script for service deployment manifests\n\nIntroduces scripts/update-deploy.sh to:\n- Scan services/ for deployable services (Dockerfile + Makefile + deploy/kustomization.yaml)\n- Auto-generate deploy/kustomization.yaml referencing all discovered services\n- Include platform/security cross-cutting concerns\n- Validate consolidated kustomization builds successfully\n\nGenerated deploy/kustomization.yaml references services/{cluster,pfsense,polaris,unifi}/deploy\nplus platform/security for data plane policies.\n\nScript always exits 0; discoveries reported informational. Run manually before\ncommits or automatically via CI to keep deploy kustomization synchronized.\n\n* refactor: update CI references to new service deploy structure\n\nUpdate service discovery and CI workflow for new layout:\n- inventory.sh: Check services/{service}/deploy/kustomization.yaml instead of ../deploy/{service}/latest/kustomization.yaml\n- Rename property from has_kustomize_latest to has_kustomize_deployment\n- CI workflow render-kustomize job: Build services/{service}/deploy instead of deploy/{service}/latest\n- Artifact naming simplified from {service}-latest.yaml to {service}.yaml\n\nAll CI path references now point to the distributed service deploy structure.\n\n* docs: update deployment structure references\n\nUpdate documentation to reflect new distributed service deploy structure:\n- docs/architecture.md: Updated repository layout to show services/{service}/deploy and auto-generated deploy/kustomization.yaml\n- README.md: Updated Contracts and Deploy section to reference services/*/deploy and consolidated deploy/kustomization.yaml\n- Added reference to deploy-standards.md for detailed deployment manifest standards\n\n* fix: address Codex findings - manifest naming and empty discovery\n\n* fix: remove -latest suffix from rendered manifest filenames\n\nDrop -latest from rendered Kubernetes manifests to avoid implying versioning\nwithin the repo. Manifests are deployment-time artifacts, not versioned within\nthe repository.\n\nChanges:\n- CI render job: rendered/{service}.yaml (was rendered/{service}-latest.yaml)\n- Release workflow artifact pattern: artifacts/rendered/*.yaml (was *-latest.yaml)\n\nThis maintains a cleaner separation between versioning at release time\n(handled by release.yaml) and deployment manifest rendering at CI time.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"12eba113385bb1bd26cb141f882dc46ef7082eb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jlfowle/asterism/git/trees/12eba113385bb1bd26cb141f882dc46ef7082eb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jlfowle/asterism/git/commits/1b12f46c67ec57af5976badbd4f13299e9b8270c","verification":{"payload":"tree 12eba113385bb1bd26cb141f882dc46ef7082eb7\nparent 70f05cb9a164599246534eb2aa8d95221a2bf6a8\nauthor Jasph Fowler <jasph.fowler@gmail.com> 1777338573 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777338573 +0000\n\nfeat: distribute deploy manifests to services with auto-discovery (#70)\n\n* docs: add deployment manifest standards\n\nEstablishes standard layout and discovery contract for service deploy manifests:\n- Per-service structure: services/{service}/deploy/kustomization.yaml + deploy/base/\n- Consolidated deploy auto-generated by scripts/update-deploy.sh\n- Service discovery based on Dockerfile, Makefile, and deploy/kustomization.yaml\n- Removes versioning-like ''latest'' folder in favor of direct kustomization.yaml\n\n* refactor: migrate service deploy manifests to services directories\n\nMove Kubernetes manifests from centralized deploy/{service}/ to distributed\nservices/{service}/deploy/:\n\n- services/{service}/deploy/base/: Contains 4 required manifest files\n  - deployment.yaml, service.yaml, route.yaml, externalsecret.yaml\n- services/{service}/deploy/kustomization.yaml: Entrypoint that references base/\n\nNew structure removes ''latest'' overlay layer and standardizes on direct\nkustomization.yaml as the contract entrypoint for consolidated deploy.\n\nAll services build successfully with: kustomize build services/{service}/deploy\n\n* feat: add auto-discovery script for service deployment manifests\n\nIntroduces scripts/update-deploy.sh to:\n- Scan services/ for deployable services (Dockerfile + Makefile + deploy/kustomization.yaml)\n- Auto-generate deploy/kustomization.yaml referencing all discovered services\n- Include platform/security cross-cutting concerns\n- Validate consolidated kustomization builds successfully\n\nGenerated deploy/kustomization.yaml references services/{cluster,pfsense,polaris,unifi}/deploy\nplus platform/security for data plane policies.\n\nScript always exits 0; discoveries reported informational. Run manually before\ncommits or automatically via CI to keep deploy kustomization synchronized.\n\n* refactor: update CI references to new service deploy structure\n\nUpdate service discovery and CI workflow for new layout:\n- inventory.sh: Check services/{service}/deploy/kustomization.yaml instead of ../deploy/{service}/latest/kustomization.yaml\n- Rename property from has_kustomize_latest to has_kustomize_deployment\n- CI workflow render-kustomize job: Build services/{service}/deploy instead of deploy/{service}/latest\n- Artifact naming simplified from {service}-latest.yaml to {service}.yaml\n\nAll CI path references now point to the distributed service deploy structure.\n\n* docs: update deployment structure references\n\nUpdate documentation to reflect new distributed service deploy structure:\n- docs/architecture.md: Updated repository layout to show services/{service}/deploy and auto-generated deploy/kustomization.yaml\n- README.md: Updated Contracts and Deploy section to reference services/*/deploy and consolidated deploy/kustomization.yaml\n- Added reference to deploy-standards.md for detailed deployment manifest standards\n\n* fix: address Codex findings - manifest naming and empty discovery\n\n* fix: remove -latest suffix from rendered manifest filenames\n\nDrop -latest from rendered Kubernetes manifests to avoid implying versioning\nwithin the repo. Manifests are deployment-time artifacts, not versioned within\nthe repository.\n\nChanges:\n- CI render job: rendered/{service}.yaml (was rendered/{service}-latest.yaml)\n- Release workflow artifact pattern: artifacts/rendered/*.yaml (was *-latest.yaml)\n\nThis maintains a cleaner separation between versioning at release time\n(handled by release.yaml) and deployment manifest rendering at CI time.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp8AjNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJA4QAIAkKb11YEL7XOoIM3NDzjiQ\nIxBLYJwFtOgtO1CC659WzqP/h3JWalAaw4VplUf84D7e52XVNlCQWzrEUT1SNs3t\nad+qLxjw7qdpz2aAAf2xHrHPVXHPqf9wfervQBkXpJ4F3O1rj4SMD0eKuJyS0x0n\ndRIv5J/KOT7mLzYuv4NlVmB3FZzODOM50wbDo5GbiUZehDkb6eppkcZ6DbLsgL+B\nVlg3TWk/8bf6KhD7s4NaWC0xdx8boZYETeD8dpwD2/99rFiT9UqCq3ZqS1Sf9u8C\nWsqYF0BZP97c1pkAMhIe5YKjpNcIu9jG0nCsx5efPzCMYO0thJDydDftQ7OUOir6\nGvnBnyJSEgAtOJMFhomkCpZS80J2iglor5whpMdHeGy0//hn3dR/ecUlilLXQoJC\nSy3efxN4VuZs0u1JSzn8u/0Cd0/Ou+MccxCAxsI7evJQqLZ1z9iTHIXj97VjCA1c\ndhXO/3leStqGEvwnE4xGLb5NXobgLACr1B2TzN1P/491YVOId+t75Vhp8BvYQ2OR\nlN60Qjh5y6LAZ6P82BRwuHDQeKAAY4hObw6rD7mUtHwCA0BaXz32BdhGiEeMej02\nBkkX6x3skTbRYP2GaJHLuDBsLjJ+tIBjYfcE7T9u1cIHvhbcAMJnQfazVvfyriUK\n5Mz42+yh8WT6dbYpS1um\n=Y6F7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-28T01:09:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_