rs/changtraisitinh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commits/804f756af56bb7351a97abb470fe97c8ff34e44f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:47:33Z","email":"nguyenhuuhiep1990@gmail.com","name":"Hiep Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:47:33Z","email":"nguyenhuuhiep1990@gmail.com","name":"Hiep Nguyen"},"message":"Add Business space page for Quỹ nhóm & Quản lý chi tiêu (#14, #16)\n\nDocument the 2 latest wired-to-real features in business language, cross-checked\nagainst backend DESIGN.md so claims (min 1.000đ/transaction, step-up threshold,\nMVP simplifications vs momo.vn/quy-nhom and momo.vn/quan-ly-chi-tieu) match what\nwas actually built, not invented. Also add a case-study note on the #14 \"money\nstuck mid-flight\" bug (3 consecutive fixes under concurrent-withdraw load) as a\nbusiness-facing lesson on why financial systems need self-healing reconciliation,\nnot just correct single-request logic.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9c2ad0de70be6846e05cc0f2f6dc43e230b5355","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/git/trees/d9c2ad0de70be6846e05cc0f2f6dc43e230b5355"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/git/commits/804f756af56bb7351a97abb470fe97c8ff34e44f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserconte