gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh","id":4078742,"login":"changtraisitinh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzg3NDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commits/00e9f12fcbde4fbd3bef81d6774d61d30a84fe37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:59:53Z","email":"nguyenhuuhiep1990@gmail.com","name":"Hiep Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:59:53Z","email":"nguyenhuuhiep1990@gmail.com","name":"Hiep Nguyen"},"message":"Hand off fund-service #14 fix to agent-tester via mailbox\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33a69afa44d8f3f16e93fe4144b6188b3bcb7d24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/git/trees/33a69afa44d8f3f16e93fe4144b6188b3bcb7d24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/git/commits/00e9f12fcbde4fbd3bef81d6774d61d30a84fe37","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4078742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh","id":4078742,"login":"changtraisitinh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzg3NDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commit/00e9f12fcbde4fbd3bef81d6774d61d30a84fe37","node_id":"C_kwDONgLF9doAKDAwZTlmMTJmY2JkZTRmYmQzYmVmODFkNjc3NGQ2MWQzMGE4NGZlMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commit/ea79283abee413c1474773da1392dc056bf09839","sha":"ea79283abee413c1474773da1392dc056bf09839","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commits/ea79283abee413c1474773da1392dc056bf09839"}],"sha":"00e9f12fcbde4fbd3bef81d6774d61d30a84fe37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commits/00e9f12fcbde4fbd3bef81d6774d61d30a84fe37"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4078742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh","id":4078742,"login":"changtraisitinh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzg3NDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commits/ea79283abee413c1474773da1392dc056bf09839/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:58:46Z","email":"nguyenhuuhiep1990@gmail.com","name":"Hiep Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:58:46Z","email":"nguyenhuuhiep1990@gmail.com","name":"Hiep Nguyen"},"message":"Fix fund-service: compensation itself can lose optimistic-lock retry under high contention (#14)\n\nUnder ≥60 concurrent withdraws on one fund, compensateWithdraw/compensateDissolve shared the same\nMAX_ATTEMPTS=4 retry budget as normal operations, and could exhaust it too — the raw\nObjectOptimisticLockingFailureException then escaped to FundController''s generic handler, returning\na 409 indistinguishable from a harmless everyday conflict even though real money was permanently\nstuck (debited from the fund, never credited to the wallet).\n\n- FundService.compensateWithRetry: dedicated, much larger retry budget (30 attempts) with jittered\n  backoff for the compensation path only, since losing this race means money is already decremented\n  locally (unlike normal ops, where losing is harmless).\n- If compensation still exhausts every attempt: persist a FundCompensationFailure row, log ERROR\n  (not warn), and return a distinct 500 that tells the caller NOT to just retry.\n- FundCompensationReconciler: scheduled job (every 15s) that retries any unresolved\n  FundCompensationFailure until it succeeds, reverting the fund''s balance/ledger exactly as the\n  immediate-path compensation would have.\n\nVerified via Ingress: 70 and 200 concurrent withdraw bursts (real HTTP load) stayed fully\nconsistent across fund_transactions/funds.balance/wallet-service TRANSFER_IN history; separately\nsimulated the \"compensation exhausted\" DB state for both WITHDRAWAL and DISSOLVE to confirm the\nbackground reconciler detects and heals it within one scheduled run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e8a7336c153b302821ecd64616b909485e67d73b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/git/trees/e8a7336c153b302821ecd64616b909485e67d73b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/git/commits/ea79283abee413c1474773da1392dc056bf09839","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4078742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh","id":4078742,"login":"changtraisitinh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzg3NDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commit/ea79283abee413c1474773da1392dc056bf09839","node_id":"C_kwDONgLF9doAKGVhNzkyODNhYmVlNDEzYzE0NzQ3NzNkYTEzOTJkYzA1NmJmMDk4Mzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commit/fca33541082bb029b58e75648db8ac58b1978279","sha":"fca33541082bb029b58e75648db8ac58b1978279","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commits/fca33541082bb029b58e75648db8ac58b1978279"}],"sha":"ea79283abee413c1474773da1392dc056bf09839","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commits/ea79283abee413c1474773da1392dc056bf09839"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4078742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh","id":4078742,"login":"changtraisitinh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzg3NDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commits/fca33541082bb029b58e75648db8ac58b1978279/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:17:58Z","email":"nguyenhuuhiep1990@gmail.com","name":"Hiep Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:17:58Z","email":"nguyenhuuhiep1990@gmail.com","name":"Hiep Nguyen"},"message":"Fix Postgres max_connections exhaustion (#24) and fund-service ledger phantom rows (#14)\n\n- #24: lower spring.datasource.hikari.maximum-pool-size to 5 across all 10 Java\n  services with a DB (default 10 x ~10 services could exceed Postgres''s default\n  max_connections=100), and raise Postgres max_connections to 200 via Helm\n  postgres.yaml args + values.yaml (and docker-compose.yml for local dev).\n  Verified live: pg_stat_activity stayed at 56/200 through a full sequential\n  pod restart cycle and two manual rolling restarts of the originally-crashing\n  bnpl-service/fund-service, with no CrashLoopBackOff.\n\n- #14: FundMutationExecutor.compensateWithdraw/compensateDissolve now delete the\n  FundTransaction row written by withdrawOnce/dissolveOnce when the follow-up\n  wallet-service credit fails and must be compensated, instead of leaving a\n  phantom ledger entry for money that never actually left the fund.\n  FundService.mapCreditFailure also maps that credit failure to a proper\n  409/502 with a Vietnamese message instead of a raw 500. Re-verified end to\n  end via Ingress with fresh users/funds: concurrent withdraw/dissolve races\n  across multiple funds show fund_transactions sums matching fund balances and\n  the creator wallet''s total credited amount exactly, with no phantom rows.\n\nBoth verified through the real Ingress path (api.ewallet-lab.local), not direct\npod/service ports. DESIGN.md updated with the max_connections/pool-budget math\nand the ledger-compensation bug writeup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d3a0effae7499256dad1ade92329fe91abc5cfa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/git/trees/d3a0effae7499256dad1ade92329fe91abc5cfa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/git/commits/fca33541082bb029b58e75648db8ac58b1978279","verification":{"payload":null,"reaso