","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commit/1a335003d1c87a158b294ed730f5e73e979526d3","node_id":"C_kwDONgLF9doAKDFhMzM1MDAzZDFjODdhMTU4YjI5NGVkNzMwZjVlNzNlOTc5NTI2ZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commit/f49d9ee7e8959078b853be6966fb9f079b94f3db","sha":"f49d9ee7e8959078b853be6966fb9f079b94f3db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commits/f49d9ee7e8959078b853be6966fb9f079b94f3db"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commit/d86b8bc1cd2a73cac0578fc9ba470c3afa191cbc","sha":"d86b8bc1cd2a73cac0578fc9ba470c3afa191cbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commits/d86b8bc1cd2a73cac0578fc9ba470c3afa191cbc"}],"sha":"1a335003d1c87a158b294ed730f5e73e979526d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commits/1a335003d1c87a158b294ed730f5e73e979526d3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commits/d86b8bc1cd2a73cac0578fc9ba470c3afa191cbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T17:25:00Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T00:02:53Z","email":"nguyenhuuhiep1990@gmail.com","name":"Hiep Nguyen"},"message":"Add mock \"Điểm thưởng\" loyalty program (issue #19)\n\nNew standalone loyalty-service (own DB ewallet_loyalty, port 8099) per\nthe operator''s decision (b) on #19:\n- Points from wallet-service''s ledger, BILL_PAYMENT only (P2P/top-up/\n  withdraw would let two accounts farm points into real cashback),\n  1 point / 10.000đ x tier multiplier, only after enrollment, each\n  wallet transaction awarded once (unique source id + row lock).\n- 4 generic tiers by rolling 12-month bill spend (x1 / 1.2 / 1.5 / 2).\n- Redeem: 1 point = 100đ cashback into the main wallet via\n  wallet-service /credit (new LOYALTY_REDEMPTION type). Points are\n  claimed first (row lock, committed), then credited; a failed credit\n  refunds the points.\n\nFound under real Postgres contention: with spring.jpa.open-in-view on,\nthe request-scoped persistence context handed SELECT ... FOR UPDATE a\nstale entity -> StaleObjectStateException -> raw 500s (money stayed\ncorrect). Turned open-in-view off here and in bnpl-service, and added\nan HTTP-level race test that fails if it is turned back on.\n\nFrontend: LoyaltyRewards screen in mfe-wallet; Home''s teaser that\nclaimed \"tích điểm\" while opening coming-soon is split into a real\n\"Điểm thưởng\" entry and a remaining coming-soon voucher teaser;\nVITE_LOYALTY_SERVICE_URL build arg; shell ''loyalty'' flow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FqnUBTTN2q5FYA3m4WsY8D","tree":{"sha":"8086a1d76d3e24fd8a5d923f547018225f1b816d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/git/trees/8086a1d76d3e24fd8a5d923f547018225f1b816d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/git/commits/d86b8bc1cd2a73cac0578fc9ba470c3afa191cbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4078742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh","id":4078742,"login":"changtraisitinh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzg3NDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commit/d86b8bc1cd2a73cac0578fc9ba470c3afa191cbc","node_id":"C_kwDONgLF9doAKGQ4NmI4YmMxY2QyYTczY2FjMDU3OGZjOWJhNDcwYzNhZmExOTFjYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commit/969d22ac3247ceafc0cfbc803357267aae3111a6","sha":"969d22ac3247ceafc0cfbc803357267aae3111a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commits/969d22ac3247ceafc0cfbc803357267aae3111a6"}],"sha":"d86b8bc1cd2a73cac0578fc9ba470c3afa191cbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commits/d86b8bc1cd2a73cac0578fc9ba470c3afa191cbc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commits/969d22ac3247ceafc0cfbc803357267aae3111a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:51:15Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T23:59:17Z","email":"nguyenhuuhiep1990@gmail.com","name":"Hiep Nguyen"},"message":"Add mock \"Ví Trả Sau\" BNPL credit line (issue #18)\n\nNew standalone bnpl-service (own DB ewallet_bnpl, port 8098) per the\noperator''s architecture decision (b) on #18:\n- Fixed 20.000.000đ mock limit, instant approval, no credit scoring.\n- Calendar-month statements due day 1 of next month (Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh),\n  33.000đ service fee only for months with a draw, 4-tier late fee\n  (5,25/10,5/15,75/21%) always recomputed from \"now\".\n- Repayment claims the debt reduction first (row-locked, committed),\n  then debits wallet-service; a failed debit reverts the exact claimed\n  allocation. Draws are serialized by the same row lock.\n- Backend refuses to open without explicit disclaimer acceptance.\n- Test-only BNPL_CLOCK_OFFSET_DAYS to exercise due dates/late tiers.\n\nwallet-service: new BNPL_REPAYMENT TransactionType, excluded from the\nmonthly outbound cap (Điều 26 TT 40/2024 exempts loan repayment).\n\nFrontend: BnplWallet screen exposed from mfe-wallet, wired from Home''s\n\"Ví Trả Sau\" mini-wallet via a new shell flow; blocking disclaimer\nmodal before first open plus a persistent banner on every state;\nVITE_BNPL_SERVICE_URL build arg; BNPL_REPAYMENT shown in history.\n\nTests: calculator unit tests + 5 concurrency tests (12 parallel full\nrepayments -> exactly one wallet debit; partial repayments never\noverpay; parallel draws never exceed the limit; failed debit reverts).\n\nHelm/docker-compose/init SQL wired; DESIGN.md (backend + frontend)\ndocuments sources, disclaimer, late-fee model, race strategy, the\nCHECK-constraint ALTER for existing DBs, and the #15 step-up gap.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FqnUBTTN2q5FYA3m4WsY8D","tree":{"sha":"9a8a082039f2faae440cb7f1c18585e827881163","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/git/trees/9a8a082039f2faae440cb7f1c18585e827881163"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/git/commits/969d22ac3247ceafc0cfbc803357267aae3111a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"