s/cloud/github/changtraisitinh.github.io\nfrom submodules into plain source copies tracked directly in this repo.\n\n- Remove tools/security/mobsf (1.7GB) and tools/orchestration/container\n  (1.2GB) entirely — too large to vendor as plain files; re-clone\n  upstream directly if needed again\n- Flatten the remaining 8 (ai/openhands, mq-container, automation-mobsf,\n  phonesploit, uber-apk-signer, redash, redash-setup,\n  changtraisitinh.github.io): drop nested .git, keep source as regular\n  files\n- Gitignore node_modules/ in ai/openhands and downloads/ in\n  mq-container (build artifacts / large binaries, not source)\n- Remove .gitmodules and all submodule config/storage\n- Update tools/README.md and root README.md to describe vendored code\n  as plain copies instead of submodules\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b558b5aa190a44b02e14bd21c72865039836c372","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/git/trees/b558b5aa190a44b02e14bd21c72865039836c372"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/git/commits/7f41f09be8f54f0463e3d411424d19f5dadd7804","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4078742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh","id":4078742,"login":"changtraisitinh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzg3NDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.