ived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/commits/340c6826a60f32a4f9abee81614d2bc012ef03e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T02:28:30Z","email":"nguyenhuuhiep1990@gmail.com","name":"Hiep Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T02:28:30Z","email":"nguyenhuuhiep1990@gmail.com","name":"Hiep Nguyen"},"message":"Restructure: redistribute devops/monitoring, rename pentest to testing, merge databases into devops\n\ndevops/monitoring/ mixed unrelated concerns (a full CMS app, workflow\norchestration, and one actual monitoring tool). Redistributed:\n- strapi/ -> poc/strapi-cms (a full-stack CMS+Next.js demo, not\n  devops tooling)\n- workflow/{cloudflare,conductor-sample,n8n} -> devops/orchestration/workflow/\n  (workflow orchestration belongs with orchestration, not monitoring)\n- nginxui/ stays in devops/monitoring/ (it''s an actual monitoring\n  dashboard tool)\n\nRenamed pentest/ -> testing/: nothing security-testing-related was\nleft in it after the tools/ move, just k6 load-test scripts\n(testing/performance/) and an empty Keploy/ideas-only folder (dropped,\nno real content or git history behind it) and empty ipatool/ (dropped).\n\nMoved databases/ -> devops/databases/: pure infra config\n(docker-compose, init scripts), consistent with the rest of devops/.\n\nAlso fixed a folder name typo: llm-chat-appp -> llm-chat-app.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b04d113ca2d29c09e92635b946b3c91eb6cfafe2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/c