mq/)\n- tools/orchestration/container (from devops/orchestration/)\n- tools/workflow/{flowise,conductor-community} (from devops/monitoring/workflow/)\n- tools/analytics/{redash,redash-setup} (from data/redash/; redash\n  re-cloned fresh since the old copy had no git history behind it)\n- feature-flags/unleash pending — still blocked on removing\n  root-owned leftover files, see .gitignore note\n\nAlso:\n- Dropped pentest/Burp-Suite-Professional-macOS (third-party Burp\n  Suite Pro cracking tool, not something to organize/preserve)\n- Dropped the stale, contentless devops/monitoring/workflow/conductor\n  gitlink\n- Removed the redundant backend/projects/poc/ wrapper:\n  poc/{auth,payment} promoted to backend/projects/{auth,payment}\n- Removed empty placeholder dirs: backend/{nodejs,python},\n  frontend/workflows\n\nPersonal/authored content (k6 scripts, the user''s own Keploy and\nConductor sample projects, their GitHub Pages site content) was left\nin place — only genuine third-party clones moved.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d38b98206c3851927d240e876bf9ddcd8f0a3cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/git/trees/4d38b98206c3851927d240e876bf9ddcd8f0a3cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changtraisitinh/fullstack-engineering-learning/git/commits/3a424ab91ea2c85499946da6a9dc6db42977e065","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4078742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/changtraisitinh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/changtraisitinh","id":4078742,"login":"changtraisiti