"html_url":"https://github.com/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commit/a3a9b7fa6f9532da583e8016988951fcbd627185","sha":"a3a9b7fa6f9532da583e8016988951fcbd627185","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/a3a9b7fa6f9532da583e8016988951fcbd627185"}],"sha":"84c8fbdd6ac542253dd79b4bca37fa119baca4cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/84c8fbdd6ac542253dd79b4bca37fa119baca4cf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/a3a9b7fa6f9532da583e8016988951fcbd627185/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T09:43:38Z","email":"SBains@cfc.com","name":"Surj Bains"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T09:43:38Z","email":"SBains@cfc.com","name":"Surj Bains"},"message":"fix(ai-rules-plugin-backend): support Azure DevOps repository URLs\n\nAzure DevOps takes the file path from the path query parameter of the repo\nURL, so appending /blob/HEAD/<file> either corrupts an existing query string\nor fails AzureUrl validation, and every read against a dev.azure.com source\nlocation returned 404. The docs already list Azure DevOps as supported.\n\nMove URL construction into shared buildFileUrl and buildTreeUrl helpers and\nuse them across the five services. This also drops the github.com /raw/main/\nspecial case, which broke on repositories whose default branch is not main.\n\nSigned-off-by: Surj Bains <SBains@cfc.com>","tree":{"sha":"696f2d91e4ed798d7bcb57b264253e0de5dd4239","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/git/trees/696f2d91e4ed798d7bcb57b264253e0de5dd4239"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/git/commits/a3a9b7fa6f9532da583e8016988951fcbd627185","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commit/a3a9b7fa6f9532da583e8016988951fcbd627185","node_id":"