gned-off-by: alex.albu <alexandru.albu@capitalontap.com>","tree":{"sha":"37fddcf72da6414824e39049fbb415db277c34bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/git/trees/37fddcf72da6414824e39049fbb415db277c34bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/git/commits/a3dbbfb0e8d735cbac3228143964e9f8316f1344","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commit/a3dbbfb0e8d735cbac3228143964e9f8316f1344","node_id":"C_kwDONhxt8NoAKGEzZGJiZmIwZThkNzM1Y2JhYzMyMjgxNDM5NjRlOWY4MzE2ZjEzNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commit/f39516f8bd949f2882c29970d62fa0f4fa5b7794","sha":"f39516f8bd949f2882c29970d62fa0f4fa5b7794","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/f39516f8bd949f2882c29970d62fa0f4fa5b7794"}],"sha":"a3dbbfb0e8d735cbac3228143964e9f8316f1344","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/a3dbbfb0e8d735cbac3228143964e9f8316f1344"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/f39516f8bd949f2882c29970d62fa0f4fa5b7794/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:22:18Z","email":"alexandru.albu@capitalontap.com","name":"alex.albu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:39:34Z","email":"alexandru.albu@capitalontap.com","name":"alex.albu"},"message":"fix(api-docs-module-crd): preserve explicit null default in simplified schemas\n\nA simplified schema with `Default: null` was dropped because the\ncapital/lowercase merge used `??`, which treats null as absent. Select\nthe default by key presence so an explicitly configured null is kept and\nrendered. Adds a test.\n\nSigned-off-by: alex.albu <alexandru.albu@capitalontap.com>","tree":{"sha":"a8ca603d6540e745cb014266c723db4e6994af68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/git/trees/a8ca603d6540e745cb014266c723db4e6994af68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/git/commits/f39516f8bd949f2882c29970d62fa0f4fa5b7794","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commit/f39516f8bd949f2882c29970d62fa0f4fa5b7794","node_id":"C_kwDONhxt8NoAKGYzOTUxNmY4YmQ5NDlmMjg4MmMyOTk3MGQ2MmZhMGY0ZmE1Yjc3OTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commit/bda90d3d527e5d20c5d9a5e58a9b09e270a9d22c","sha":"bda90d3d527e5d20c5d9a5e58a9b09e270a9d22c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/bda90d3d527e5d20c5d9a5e58a9b09e270a9d22c"}],"sha":"f39516f8bd949f2882c29970d62fa0f4fa5b7794","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/f39516f8bd949f2882c29970d62fa0f4fa5b7794"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/bda90d3d527e5d20c5d9a5e58a9b09e270a9d22c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:48:59Z","email":"alexandru.albu@capitalontap.com","name":"alex.albu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:39:34Z","email":"alexandru.albu@capitalontap.com","name":"alex.albu"},"message":"feat(api-docs-module-crd): show field defaults and enum values\n\nThe CRD schema view showed each property''s type, description and required\nstatus, but not the default value or the allowed values of an enum, so\nkubebuilder-derived defaults were invisible in the API docs.\n\nCarry `default` and `enum` through normalizeSchema (using nullish\ncoalescing so a falsy default such as `false`, `0` or `\"\"` survives),\nrender the default as a chip in the property header, and list enum\nallowed values in the property details. Both the Kubernetes and\nsimplified schema formats are supported. Adds tests and updates the\nplugin README and docs site.\n\nSigned-off-by: alex.albu <alexandru.albu@capitalontap.com>","tree":{"sha":"d98cb950202b127451ecdff3815adaef125c3848","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/git/trees/d98cb950202b127451ecdff3815adaef125c3848"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/git/commits/bda90d3d527e5d20c5d9a5e58a9b09e270a9d22c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commit/bda90d3d527e5d20c5d9a5e58a9b09e270a9d22c","node_id":"C_kwDONhxt8NoAKGJkYTkwZDNkNTI3ZTVkMjBjNWQ5YTVlNThhOWIwOWUyNzBhOWQyMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commit/1c7ff9ef1ba4e0e3cf51690bef6c3953ef7bc7db","sha":"1c7ff9ef1ba4e0e3cf51690bef6c3953ef7bc7db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/1c7ff9ef1ba4e0e3cf51690bef6c3953ef7bc7db"}],"sha":"bda90d3d527e5d20c5d9a5e58a9b09e270a9d22c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/bda90d3d527e5d20c5d9a5e58a9b09e270a9d22c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/d6a9c38f53f8424217183a91effcdf732b9706fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T15:18:23Z","email":"sbains@cfc.com","name":"Surj Bains"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T15:22:32Z","email":"sbains@cfc.com","name":"Surj Bains"},"message":"fix(terasky-utils): merge into a workspace kustomization.yaml before the remote lookup\n\nThe existing-resource lookup only speaks the GitHub contents API, so a publish\nflow that clones the repository into the workspace first — Azure DevOps — found\nno existing resources and rewrote kustomization.yaml with only the new entry,\ndropping everything already listed in the repository.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nSigned-off-by: Surj Bains <sbains@cfc.com>","tree":{"sha":"c15333d687e3001daf1cbce5d175b3c6d5089751","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/git/trees/c15333d687e3001daf1cbce5d175b3c6d5089751"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/git/commits/d6a9c38f53f8424217183a91effcdf732b9706fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commit/d6a9c38f53f8424217183a91effcdf732b9706fe","node_id":"C_kwDONhxt8NoAKGQ2YTljMzhmNTNmODQyNDIxNzE4M2E5MWVmZmNkZjczMmI5NzA2ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commit/9b2c268e0f61baa1aef912d29acbc9b9edf84dae","sha":"9b2c268e0f61baa1aef912d29acbc9b9edf84dae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/9b2c268e0f61baa1aef912d29acbc9b9edf84dae"}],"sha":"d6a9c38f53f8424217183a91effcdf732b9706fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/d6a9c38f53f8424217183a91effcdf732b9706fe"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/9b2c268e0f61baa1aef912d29acbc9b9edf84dae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:50:25Z","email":"sbains@cfc.com","name":"Surj Bains"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T15:22:32Z","email":"sbains@cfc.com","name":"Surj Bains"},"message":"fix(kubernetes-ingestor): clone before push and write manifests at the annotated repo path for Azure DevOps\n\nazure:repository:push stages and commits an existing working copy, so the\npublish sequence needs azure:repository:clone ahead of manifest generation.\nIt also accepts only sourcePath, so the terasky.backstage.io/target-path\nannotation cannot be applied via targetPath as it is for the other targets.\n\nterasky:claim-template gains xrdPathInWorkspace, which resolves the path\ntemplate on disk instead of writing to the workspace root, and the ingestor\nsets it for Azure targets and no longer emits an ignored targetPath.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nSigned-off-by: Surj Bains <sbains@cfc.com>","tree":{"sha":"f3cccbe478b1949ba4ee9e19736a5b1728586912","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/git/trees/f3cccbe478b1949ba4ee9e19736a5b1728586912"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/git/commits/9b2c268e0f61baa1aef912d29acbc9b9edf84dae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commit/9b2c268e0f61baa1aef912d29acbc9b9edf84dae","node_id":"C_kwDONhxt8NoAKDliMmMyNjhlMGY2MWJhYTFhZWY5MTJkMjlhY2JjOWI5ZWRmODRkYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commit/02760d6a9959c5d9c86ade39db8f11352dc84d2a","sha":"02760d6a9959c5d9c86ade39db8f11352dc84d2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/02760d6a9959c5d9c86ade39db8f11352dc84d2a"}],"sha":"9b2c268e0f61baa1aef912d29acbc9b9edf84dae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/9b2c268e0f61baa1aef912d29acbc9b9edf84dae"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/commits/02760d6a9959c5d9c86ade39db8f11352dc84d2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:29:41Z","email":"sbains@cfc.com","name":"Surj Bains"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T15:22:32Z","email":"sbains@cfc.com","name":"Surj Bains"},"message":"fix(kubernetes-ingestor): address Azure DevOps review comments\n\nCatch invalid RepoUrlPicker values, default allowedHosts to\ndev.azure.com, inject target-path onto Azure publish steps, and\nbuild the Open Pull Request link from remoteUrl and pullRequestId.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nSigned-off-by: Surj Bains <sbains@cfc.com>","tree":{"sha":"28af9290f67310e468648670dabc3df0e86e84fb","url":"https://ap