tityProvider tests for delta-based ingestion\n\nAdd getClusters mock to mockResourceFetcher so the new run() flow can resolve\nthe active cluster list (the old code used fetchKubernetesObjects() which\ncaught the missing-method error internally and silently returned an empty list,\nwhile the new code calls getClusters() directly before the cluster loop).\n\nUpdate the \"should handle run errors gracefully\" assertion: with getClusters()\nrejecting, activeClusters falls back to [] and the cache is empty, so there\nare no entities to diff and applyMutation is correctly not called. The test\nstill verifies the run completes without throwing.","tree":{"sha":"a6c5c4e73cb14b76e13095f9210eec5c58ad5fa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/git/trees/a6c5c4e73cb14b76e13095f9210eec5c58ad5fa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeraSky-OSS/backstage-plugins/git/commits/19ec00beaa9506f53cb58d5bf4ac8b2fbe39e717","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48493016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrabbi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrabbi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrabbi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrabbi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vrabbi","id":48493016,"login":"vrabbi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NDkzMDE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrabbi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrabbi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrabbi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrabbi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrabbi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrabbi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.c